The my355 binary is rebuilt here against Apostrophe with Zlyme Flip
joystick mapping (NextUI JOY_*). Stock Apostrophe treats the Flip as
keyboard scancodes; this image's joypad emits joystick events.
ScreenScraper developer credentials are the same ones baked into the
upstream 2.3.0 release binary.
